#. but contains no playable audio items.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:569
msgid "No playable audio file was found in this book's LibriVox feed."
msgstr ""
"Não foi encontrado nenhum ficheiro de áudio reproduzível no feed LibriVox "
"deste livro."

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; mutes/unmutes all of freeAudio's
