#. are also appended to a plain text file on disk.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:107
msgid "Turn on or off saving liked songs to a text file"
msgstr ""
"Ativar ou desativar a gravação de músicas favoritas num ficheiro de texto"

#. Translators: Feature name for the save-liked-songs toggle, used the same way
#. as the track-change one above (checkbox label with '&' access key, and
#. %(effect)s with it stripped).
#. Translators: Checkbox label for the save-liked-songs setting (same feature
#. as the toggleSaveLikedSongs command).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:127
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:343
