#. regardless of whether ICY metadata exists.
#. Translators: Same as elsewhere, spoken when this standalone gesture starts
#. forced Shazam recognition.
#. Translators: Same as the Ctrl+Win+I fourth-press case, spoken here by the F2
#. dialog equivalent.
